 east toward Wuhan and Shanghai."],"time":"2026-11-10 10:10","time1":"10:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":28,"move":"flyover","at":"up","to":"res","alt":180,"pitch":-10,"zh":["從上游庫區沿著江面飛向大壩。","水位上升後，原本的峽谷成了寬闊的湖面。"],"en":["Flying down the reservoir toward the dam.","With the water raised, the old gorge has become a broad lake."],"time":"2026-11-10 10:20","time1":"10:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":24,"move":"orbit","at":"dam","alt":900,"dist":4200,"from":191,"arc":40,"pitch":-14,"zh":["三峽工程結合防洪、發電與航運，","是長江治理的關鍵工程。"],"en":["The project combines flood control, power generation and navigation,","and is a key work in managing the Yangtze."],"time":"2026-11-10 10:30","time1":"10:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":32,"move":"orbit","at":"dam","alt":1100,"dist":4800,"from":271,"arc":40,"pitch":-14,"zh":["接下來三部影片，看它的結構、施工與影響。","地形資料早於水庫蓄水，水面依 175 公尺水位繪出。","本片為電腦擬真重建：結構依公開資料簡化建模，","地形取自公開高程資料，不是實地空拍畫面。"],"en":["The next three films look at its structure, its construction and its impact.","The terrain data predate the reservoir; the water is drawn at the 175 m level.","A computer reconstruction: the structures are simplified models built from public data,","and the terrain comes from public elevation data. This is not real drone footage."],"time":"2026-11-10 10:40","time1":"10:45","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}}]},{"id":"works-structure","theme":"works-structure","title":{"zh-Hant":"三峽大壩：結構與技術","en":"Three Gorges Dam: Structure"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"重力壩、電廠、五級船閘與升船機","en":"Gravity dam, power stations, five-step locks and a ship lift"},"time":"2026-11-10 13:30","weather":"clear","season":"a