 them."],"time":"2026-11-11 08:40","time1":"08:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":29,"move":"orbit","at":"dam","alt":260,"dist":1700,"from":151,"arc":30,"pitch":-8,"works":{"hide":["res","lift"],"rise":{"dam":[40,150],"locks":[30,120]}},"zh":["混凝土一層一層往上澆築，","壩體逐年升高。畫面示意壩體由下往上長高。"],"en":["Concrete was placed layer upon layer","and the dam rose year by year. Shown here: the dam growing from the bottom up."],"time":"2026-11-11 08:50","time1":"08:55","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"locks","alt":240,"dist":900,"from":200,"arc":50,"pitch":-12,"works":{"hide":["res","lift"],"rise":{"dam":[150,160]}},"zh":["北岸的船閘在山體中開挖出來，","兩線五級的閘室一路往下，連接上下游。"],"en":["On the north bank the locks were dug out of the mountain:","two lines of five chambers stepping down from upstream to downstream."],"time":"2026-11-11 09:00","time1":"09:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"dam","alt":380,"dist":2400,"from":130,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"works":{"hide":["lift"],"rise":{"dam":[160,186]},"level":{"res":[80,135]}},"zh":["2003 年水庫開始蓄水，","7 月 10 日，第一台機組開始發電。"],"en":["In 2003 the reservoir began to fill,","and on 10 July the first generating unit started up."],"time":"2026-11-11 09:10","time1":"09:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}},{"dur":27,"move":"push","at":"dam","alt":200,"dist0":2400,"dist":1200,"from":281,"pitch":-8,"works":{"hide":["lift"],"level":{"res":[135,156]}},"zh":["2006 年壩體全線完工，","同年 10 月水位升到 156 公尺。"],"en":["In 2006 the dam body was completed along its whole length,","and in October that year the water reached 156 m."],"time":"2026-11-11 09:20","time1":"09:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.