 structures are simplified models built from public data,","and the terrain comes from public elevation data. This is not real drone footage."],"time":"2026-11-11 10:10","time1":"10:15","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.2,"base":2000},"grade":{"warm":0.6,"sat":1.1,"contrast":1.06}}}]},{"id":"works-impact","theme":"works-impact","title":{"zh-Hant":"三峽大壩：功能與影響","en":"Three Gorges Dam: Use and Impact"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"防洪、發電、航運，以及它的代價","en":"Flood control, power and shipping, and the price paid"},"time":"2026-11-11 14:00","weather":"clear","season":"autumn","shots":[{"dur":30,"move":"reveal","at":"res","weather":"few","alt":600,"dist0":4600,"dist":2800,"from":110,"pitch":-10,"zh":["水庫最主要的任務之一是防洪：","可調節的防洪庫容約 220 億立方公尺。"],"en":["One of the reservoir's main jobs is flood control:","about 22 billion cubic metres of its capacity are set aside for floods."],"time":"2026-11-11 14:00","time1":"14:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"dam","alt":380,"dist":2400,"from":211,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"works":{"level":{"res":[175,145]}},"zh":["每年雨季前，水位從 175 公尺降到約 145 公尺，","騰出空間來容納洪水。"],"en":["Before each rainy season the level is lowered from 175 m to about 145 m,","making room to hold back floodwater."],"time":"2026-11-11 14:10","time1":"14:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"north","alt":180,"dist":800,"from":101,"arc":50,"pitch":-8,"zh":["發電方面，2018 年發電約 1,016 億度，","2020 年更創下約 1,120 億度的紀錄。"],"en":["As for power, it generated about 101.6 billion kWh in 2018,","and set a record of about 112 billion kWh in 2020."],"time":"2026-11-11 14:20","time1":"14:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"locks","alt":280,"dist":1000,"from":250,"arc":40,"pitch":-12,"zh":["航運方面，萬噸級的船隊可以通過船閘，","長江上游的水路運輸因此大幅改善。"],"en":["For shipping, fleets of up to 10,000 tonnes can pass the locks,","greatly improving river transport on the upper Yangtze."],"time":"2026-11-11 14:30","time1":"14:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":32,"move":"flyover","at":"up","to":"res","alt":260,"pitch":-10,"zh":["代價也很大：水庫淹沒了許多城鎮與村莊，","約 113 萬到 140 萬人搬離家園。"],"en":["The cost was high too: the reservoir drowned many towns and villages,","and between 1.13 and 1.4 million people had to leave their homes."],"time":"2026-11-11 14:40","time1":"14:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.35,"base":1800,"kind":"mixed"},"grade":{"warm":0.15,"sat":1.04,"contrast":1.03}}},{"dur":29,"move":"orbit","at":"up","alt":450,"dist":2600,"from":200,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"zh":["大量文物遺址在蓄水前進行搶救發掘，","也有許多古蹟永遠沉入水下。"],"en":["Many archaeological sites were excavated in a rush before the water rose,","and many historic places now lie under the water for good."],"time":"2026-11-11 14:50","time1":"14:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.35,"base":1800,"kind":"mixed"},"grade":{"warm":0.15,"sat":1.04,"contrast":1.03}}},{"dur":29,"move":"orbit","at":"res","alt":520,"dist":3000,"from":60,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"zh":["泥沙淤積在壩前、庫岸邊坡滑動，","以及蓄水後的地震活動，都是長期監測的課題。"],"en":["Silt settling behind the dam, landslides on the reservoir banks","and earthquakes since the filling all need long-term monitoring."],"time":"2026-11-11 15:00","time1":"15:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.35,"base":1800,"kind":"mixed"},"grade":{"warm":0.15,"sat":1.04,"contrast":1.03}}},{"dur":29,"move":"pull","at":"down","alt":320,"dist0":800,"dist":3000,"from":300,"pitch":-10,"zh":["下游的泥沙減少，河床與河口的變化，","以及白鱀豚、長江白鱘等物種的衰退，也備受關注。"],"en":["Less silt downstream, changes to the river bed and the estuary,","and the decline of species such as the baiji dolphin and the Chinese paddlefish draw concern."],"t